{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50292","headline":"青海卧疾之作 一 · 佚名","name":"青海卧疾之作 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"数日穹庐卧疾时，百方投药力将微。\n惊魂漫漫迷山际，怯魄悠悠傍海涯。\n旋知命与浮云合，可叹身同朝露曦。\n男儿到此须甘分，何假含啼枕上悲！。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50292.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50292","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}